The Scott "TCB" Turner writes:
3.> (a) Open/closed/no doors will have different symbols in Patchlevel 6.

st> Good.  (Locked?)

Locked doors are closed doors.  Broken doors are displayed as no doors.
To illustrate:

closed			--+--				|
							|
open, horizontal	--|--	open, vertical		-
							|
none			--.--				|

Doorless doorways can be entered diagonally.


